                "description": "Schlage FE575 Camelot Keypad Entry Lock Deadlatch - Schlage FE575 Camelot Keypad Entry Lock With Auto Lock features a grade 2 deadbolt and six digit programing mechanical key override. The simple elegance of the Accent will enhance any room's warmth and beauty.",
